      padWork: { description: "Holding positions: Partner holds pads for shot/sprawl practice, provides resistance for hand fighting, absorbs impact for takedown mechanics. Strike sequences: called combinations (shot-sprawl-counter), progressive resistance (light → firm → reactive). Cues: Partner provides verbal/visual triggers, moves with wrestler to simulate opponent reactions, gives feedback on technique efficiency." },
